      "supply.stationHint": ["Ouvrir le poste de secours", "Open emergency supplies"],
      "supply.lockedHint": ["Poste de secours \xB7 disponible vague {wave}", "Emergency supplies \xB7 available from wave {wave}"],
      "supply.crateNote": ["La caisse reste dehors. Un choix gratuit par joueur \xE0 chaque vague de 2 \xE0 18. Reprendre un bonus augmente son niveau jusqu\u2019\xE0 8 ; tous se cumulent. Ils survivent \xE0 une mise \xE0 terre et sont d\xE9pos\xE9s apr\xE8s \xE9limination.", "The crate stays outside. One free choice per player each wave from 2 to 18. Taking a bonus again raises its level up to 8; bonuses stack. They survive being downed and drop on elimination."],
      "supply.stationNote": ["Kit de rel\xE8ve d\xE8s la vague 5. Sac d\xE8s la vague 10, conserv\xE9 jusqu\u2019\xE0 la prochaine partie. Autres services d\xE8s la vague 15 : un achat par joueur et par vague. Aucune pi\xE8ce d\xE9pens\xE9e si tu ne peux rien recevoir.", "Revive kit from wave 5. Backpack from wave 10, kept until the next game. Other services from wave 15: one purchase per player per wave. No coins are spent if you cannot receive anything."],
      "bonus.catalog": ["Bonus \xB7 niveaux 1\u20138", "Bonuses \xB7 levels 1\u20138"],
