      "gamepad.assistStrong": ["Forte", "Strong"],
      "gamepad.aimAssistHelp": ["L\xE9g\xE8re reprend l\u2019ancienne aide normale ; Normale est renforc\xE9e ; Forte accompagne davantage. Pendant tes mouvements au stick, l\u2019aide ralentit le regard et suit l\xE9g\xE8rement les ennemis visibles. Aucun effet sur la souris, ni vis\xE9e automatique de la t\xEAte.", "Light matches the previous Normal assist; Normal is stronger; Strong gives more assistance. While you move the stick, assistance slows your look and gently follows visible enemies. No effect on mouse aim or automatic head targeting."],
